message: "If you use this software or its data artifacts in your research, please cite it as follows."
title: "act_inf_metaanalysis: A computational meta-analysis of the Active Inference literature"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible computational meta-analysis snapshot of the Active Inference and
  Free Energy Principle literature: multi-source retrieval (arXiv, Semantic
  Scholar, OpenAlex), LLM-based assertion extraction as nanopublications,
  citation-weighted hypothesis triage across eight standard hypotheses, and
  publication-ready visualization and manuscript generation.
